  "notes": "The Ethereum payment token is the main contract because it is the asset used to buy work in the documented Ethereum flow and the sampled Intake receipt. Contract roles come from the project API address tables, the docs crosschain table, the POOL4 docs and the Community Coins app configuration. Third-party infrastructure and projects launched for customers are outside the contract inventory. Weak ties for the imd.fun site and Community Coins come from the site docs and the app bundle respectively. A link from a project website alone does not qualify as a strong tie. The @IMD_IdentityMD tie reflects its pinned address and its bio describes the account as community run. Contract state reads are block snapshots. The sample payment refers to tokens transferred and excludes transaction gas."
